<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT - GOLDMAN STARTS VNU .</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - GOLDMAN STARTS VNU .</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs initiated coverage of Dutch publisher NV Verenigd Bezit VNU with a &quot;market outperformer&quot; rating, the investment bank said on Monday.</p>
<p>Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4366</p>
